# Cloudflare Pages response headers for PTSBuilderLite.
#
# A real header rather than the <meta> tag the Electron build injects, which is
# what lets `frame-ancestors` work at all — a meta-tag CSP cannot set it.
#
# `connect-src 'none'` is not aspirational. Fonts are self-hosted through
# @fontsource-variable/geist, the parts catalog is bundled from
# src/data/parts.json, designs autosave to localStorage, and the BOM PDF is
# generated in the page. Nothing here makes a network request after load, so if
# this policy ever needs loosening, something has been added that should have
# been discussed first.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; frame-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin

# Vite fingerprints these, so a given URL's contents never change.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# The entry document must not be cached, or a deploy is invisible until the
# browser decides otherwise.
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
